<h2>New Scholarship Match Found!</h2>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>We found a new scholarship matching your profile with a match score of <strong>{{score}}%</strong>.</p>

<ul>
    {{#if programName}}<li><strong>Program:</strong> {{programName}}</li>{{/if}}
    {{#if provider}}<li><strong>Provider:</strong> {{provider}}</li>{{/if}}
    {{#if country}}<li><strong>Country:</strong> {{country}}</li>{{/if}}
    {{#if deadline}}<li><strong>Deadline:</strong> {{deadline}}</li>{{/if}}
</ul>

<p>Log in to your GOA portal to review the details and apply.</p>
